{"id":"vod_md_5622","vodId":"5622","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"银砂糖师与黑色妖精 Part.2","name_cn":"银砂糖师与黑色妖精 Part.2","date":"2023-01-01","year":"2023","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"12集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20231004-1/b85e759cf9e5133481ee5a88239dc916.jpg"},"summary":"被砂糖苹果引导的少女和妖精——\r\n\r\n2人的梦想与爱恋编织的童话——\r\n\r\n在人类使役妖精、相信砂糖点心能带来幸运的世界里，制作神圣砂糖点心的特别的砂糖点心师傅们，被称作“银砂糖师”。\r\n\r\n少女“安”的母亲是一流银砂糖师，可惜，她的母亲早早就撒手人寰。安决定继承亡母的意志——成为银砂糖师。\r\n\r\n为此，她必须在每年一次的王都品评会上大放光彩，让世间承认她的作为银砂糖师的能力。\r\n\r\n王都旅途中，安雇佣了一位战士妖精——夏尔。\r\n\r\n这战士妖精干架本领毋庸置疑，就是嘴巴有点儿毒……\r\n\r\n他不相信人类，和安争吵不断。\r\n\r\n但是，与夏尔一起旅行的安，开始想和他成为朋友。\r\n\r\n人类安和妖精夏尔的种族和立场各不相同，面对重重困难会编织出怎样的未来？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-10-04 08:12:59","episodeCount":12,"playable":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231003/5zzAKGOv/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231003/W0jVTp0g/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231003/MIMtptjm/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231003/tVEP33bj/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231003/3b8igHQZ/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231003/Yz4pMVQv/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231003/YV6d8DUH/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231003/VSsME4jz/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231003/MwDfICho/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231003/rUqZCQk9/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231003/4BZZ9Bv4/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231003/7Bic7BQr/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-21T08:56:53.661Z"}